        "original_id": "a65ffde2-0020-5380-946f-c7373cdc8091",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dexter Fletcher, Guy Ritchie, Matthew Vaughn, Jason Flemyng, Nick Moran, Jason Statham, Steven Mackintosh, Vinnie Jones, Sting\n- Products: Lock, Stock and Two Smoking Barrels, Smoking Guns, Hotel Babylon, Band of Brothers, Press Gang, Bugsy Malone\n- Topics: film and television roles\n\nFacts:\n- Earlier in his career, Dexter Fletcher appeared in the children's show Press Gang and the film Bugsy Malone.\n- In 1998, Lock, Stock and Two Smoking Barrels was released as a British crime comedy film written and directed by Guy Ritchie and produced by Matthew Vaughn.\n- Lock, Stock and Two Smoking Barrels starred an ensemble cast including Jason Flemyng, Dexter Fletcher, Nick Moran, Jason Statham, Steven Mackintosh, Vinnie Jones, and Sting.\n- Dexter Fletcher appeared in the Guy Ritchie film Lock, Stock and Two Smoking Barrels and in the crime comedy Smoking Guns.\n- Dexter Fletcher also had television roles in Hotel Babylon and the HBO series Band of Brothers.",
